    "13 2026-09-22  figure palette (arms, cell groups, neutral greys and accent) moved into the config",
    "14 2026-09-22  Figure 17: neuropathology table and sheet named exactly, with their column names; CPS column names; the 28 stain measures, their families and the 17C blocks listed by exact name (replaces the stain-family patterns); CaH has no sequencing; Figure 17 labels and colours",
    "15 2026-09-22  Figure 17 strip, verdict and grain colours set to the archived Part12q values (strip #1F3864; verdicts #2D2D2D, #7B7B7B, #1275D8, #D9D9D9, #FBE7A2, #F2F2F2; grains #2E7D5B, #D95F02, #24456F)",
